WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.875 --> 00:00:03.000
- [Narrator:] Once every generation...

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.083
a new star arrives.

00:00:09.625 --> 00:00:12.375
- [Spaceship:] Undesirable destination confirmed.

00:00:12.666 --> 00:00:15.166
- [Laughing] C'est super.

00:00:17.125 --> 00:00:19.458
- [Narrator:] And everyone prepares for him.

00:00:19.458 --> 00:00:21.666
- Shaquillum O'Nealus!

00:00:22.833 --> 00:00:24.583
- [Narrator:] He can turn another young star

00:00:25.166 --> 00:00:26.625
into a second fiddle.

00:00:30.833 --> 00:00:32.208
He can build somethin'

00:00:32.208 --> 00:00:35.208
out of all those bricks you've been pilin' up.

00:00:40.625 --> 00:00:43.125
He can restart a fanbase's engine.

00:00:50.541 --> 00:00:52.083
And finally answer...

00:00:53.291 --> 00:00:55.375
all your tough questions.

00:00:57.916 --> 00:01:01.708
He can even stop the greedy from hoardin'.

00:01:03.208 --> 00:01:05.166
And maybe,

00:01:05.166 --> 00:01:07.208
just maybe, he could stop our drought.

00:01:19.541 --> 00:01:20.750
- Bonjour!

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:23.416
Which lucky souls has won the Wemby lottery?

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:25.083
- [Gregg Popovich:] And if he doesn't land here...

00:01:25.083 --> 00:01:26.708
I mean, I’ll take a flier Scoot. I don't care.

00:01:26.708 --> 00:01:27.916
I’m gonna live forever.

